                                "sense_id": "375f8966-f92b-3994-b1c1-3904d63973d1",
                                "text": "You rode the blimp here, didn't you? Boy, I envy you. I'm dying to ride that thing, but air travel makes me yack."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f284f6bf-4f66-416f-89a8-71bd8b769d43",
                                "sense_id": "375f8966-f92b-3994-b1c1-3904d63973d1",
                                "text": "“If we do a deal, no one ever hears about it. Others yack but Iwan never does. It is very Swiss.”"
                            }
